      "label": "(1)",
      "text": "The drug reservoir 101 holds liquid pain-killer supplied by the hospital pharmacy and loaded into the PCA pump by the clinician. (UC1.10 §4.1.1)",
      "id": null
    },
    {
      "section": "6.8",
      "label": "(2)",
      "text": "The drug reservoir shall measure its contents. 102 (EC20 §4.2.20 EC21 §4.2.21)",
